,"municipality_code":"02321","municipality_pref":"青森県","municipality_name":"鰺ヶ沢町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"802"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.18601989746094,40.768882751464844]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"長平高原","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 火山性高原","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"02321","municipality_pref":"青森県","municipality_name":"鰺ヶ沢町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"103"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.27499389648438,40.714447021484375]}}],"display_comment_original":"鰺ヶ沢町周辺には、近世村の記憶として舞戸村、田浦村、館村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、赤石城跡、種里城跡、鰺ヶ沢御仮屋跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、舞戸村、田浦村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["綾櫻由太郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["白神山地（世界遺産）","白神の森 遊山道","種里城址（国の史跡、大浦光信公の館）","くろくまの滝（日本の滝百選）","鰺ヶ沢海水浴場","長平青少年旅行村","青森スプリング","海底遺跡"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B0%BA%E3%83%B6%E6%B2%A2%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11607310"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"鰺ヶ沢町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110942340","wikidata_qid":"Q1347560","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B0%BA%E3%83%B6%E6%B2%A2%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}